  "description": "I1 probe for prop:hoefsmit-seminormal-form.  Verifies that for every partition λ ⊢ n with 2 ≤ n ≤ 6, the canonical Hoefsmit-seminormal matrices satisfy both (i) the Hecke quadratic σ² = (q−q⁻¹)σ + 𝟙 on every generator and (ii) the braid relation σ_i σ_{i+1} σ_i = σ_{i+1} σ_i σ_{i+1} on every adjacent pair.  Also confirms dim ρ_λ = |SYT(λ)| (Hoefsmit's seminormal dimension).  This is the foundational gate for the entire H_n probe cluster of PR #818 — a failure here would invalidate downstream character checks.",
